##
    One of the two programs this project holds, and the one it begins at.

    Its name is Observatory.Cataloging.Program. The other is Observatory.Ranking.Program, and
    the two do not collide: a namespace is part of a type's name, so these are two types rather
    than one name written twice.
##

namespace Observatory.Cataloging;

shared model Program

    function Main()
        Console.WriteLine("== the catalog ==");

        loop each star in Sky.Brightest()
            Console.WriteLine("  {{star.name}} at magnitude {{star.magnitude:F2}}");
        end loop
    end function

end model
